abstract: "First-principles simulation framework for topological Zero-Point Fluctuation (ZPF) synthetic gravity generation via near-field capacitive displacement coupling and TiN/SiO2 metamaterial back-reflector shielding. Achieves 50% active bus power reduction (9.25 kW for 3,125 N lift) and zero backside force spillover."
